<title>USA: Boston Edison says holders ok holding co.</title>
<headline>Boston Edison says holders ok holding co.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston Edison Co said Friday its shareholders voted to create an unregulated holding company to be called BEC Energy.</p>
<p>The company said Boston Edison Co will remain as a regulated utility.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to obtain state and federal approvals by the end of the year.</p>
